  "bio": {
    "short": "XiiX is a Kenya-based hip-hop artist from Sabaki known for poetic, genre-flexible rap and frequent collaborations with Culture Szn.",
    "long": "XiiX is a Kenya-based hip-hop artist associated with the Culture Szn movement. Based in Sabaki, his work leans into lyrical, poetic rap while staying flexible across modern rap textures. He is also known by the monikers “Mr. Wrong number” and “Ras Houdini,” and has released collaborative records with Culture Szn."
